{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ad8c532d-c70f-8d7c-93dd-0e85beef6201",
  "created_at": "2026-01-16T12:22:34-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Walter Burdick",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T12:20:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City of Newport Finance Department, this is Janet Whitcomb. How may I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T12:20:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Walter Burdick. I'm calling for my mother. She got a late notice on a parking ticket, but she already paid it online. So what do I do about that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T12:20:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can look into that. Do you have the ticket number, or the license plate on the vehicle?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T12:20:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on. Okay, the plate I've got. Hold on, buddy, the baking soda goes in the little cup, not the big one. Sorry. Yeah, the plate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T12:20:35-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time, sir."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T12:20:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the plate on my mother's Buick. She lives at 337 Marsh Street, down the Point. I'll read it to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T12:20:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead, please. And I'll need the plate letter by letter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T12:20:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. I'm reading it off the notice. It's Tango Four Seven Two Nine Delta. Wait, no, Four Seven Two Nine Bravo. Sorry, Bravo."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T12:20:57-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bravo. Thank you. One moment while I pull that up. [pause] I see the ticket here, and I see a payment recorded. It looks like the late notice went out before the payment posted to the account."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T12:21:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the notice is wrong, basically."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T12:21:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It crossed with the payment. If she has the confirmation email, keep it. The account shows paid, so she doesn't owe a late fee based on what I'm seeing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T12:21:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And if she wants to appeal the original ticket, how long does that take?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T12:21:29-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "An appeal is handled separately, and the time varies. Generally it's a matter of weeks. But since the ticket has been paid, she should know that may affect how it's treated. I'd suggest the hearing office for the specifics."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T12:21:42-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine, I'll ask them. Different question. I'm leaving on a trip Sunday. If I need to pay something before I go, can I do it without coming to City Hall? Like at night or on a weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T12:21:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Payments can be made on the City's website at any hour. There's also a secure drop box outside City Hall for checks. Please include the ticket number on the check."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T12:22:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Online is fine. Does it work on a phone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T12:22:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It does. Just have the ticket number or plate handy, as you did today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T12:22:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Yes, the little cup, I said. Sorry. So the late notice is a non-issue and I should keep the confirmation. That's it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T12:22:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's correct. Is there anything else I can assist you with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T12:22:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T12:22:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon, and safe travels."
    }
  ],
